# Goatnap: "Gain control of target creature until end of turn. Untap that creature. It gains haste until end of turn. If that
# creature is a Goat, it also gets +3/+0 until end of turn." Bot2 has a Mountain Goat (1/1, a Goat) and a Llanowar Elves (1/1,
# not a Goat), both tapped on their turn. Bot1 takes the Goat with one Goatnap (CR 613.1b): untapped, hasty, and 4/1 - only the
# power rises (CR 613.4c) - so it hits for 4 (CR 702.10). The next turn Bot1 takes the Elves: it attacks as the 1/1 it is.

